    "attributions.html": {
      "settings": {
        "meta_descr": "",
        "title": "Attributions",
        "order": 3
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "P": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            "H1": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#c1c1c1"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "header16",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"header1\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#1b1e23\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-10 align-center\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Pools of the Deep VR</h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">\n                    Beautiful mobile websites\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><i><b>Attribution list</b></i><br><br>\"Greek Shield\" (https://skfb.ly/o8FXt) by emelyarules is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Amazon frieze -  British Museum\" (https://skfb.ly/ow86u) by Arqueomodel3D is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Plaque des Ergastines (Louvre museum)\" (https://skfb.ly/prXsr) by Antoine Dresen is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Neptú, Biblioteca Museu Víctor Balaguer\" (https://skfb.ly/o7vNR) by Giravolt is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>“Mermaid” (https://skfb.ly/6vp9r) by Moshe Caine is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Gold coin\" (https://skfb.ly/oCDzo) by mikeW is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Flying Drone Character\" (https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/robots/flying-drone-character-321592)&nbsp; by MyNameIsVoo.<br><br>\"Banana man\" (https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/banana-man-196830) by&nbsp;Banana Yellow Games.<br><br>“Roman Bronze Theater Mask” (https://skfb.ly/ptNNG) by yugengen is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Terracotta Theatrical Mask” (https://skfb.ly/ptMAG) by yugengen is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Satyr Roman Mask” (https://skfb.ly/ptLXM) by yugengen is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Colossal Marble Head Of Constantine\" (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/colossal-marble-head-of-constantine-textured-81bc6bcf201c4c0e9128d5042c230b1f) by&nbsp;Glenn Gunhouse&nbsp;is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Free Rubber Duck 3d Model\" (https://skfb.ly/oGQXr) by Ryan King Art is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Colossal statue of Constantine: foot\" (https://www.myminifactory.com/object/3d-print-colossal-statue-of-constantine-foot-33164) by ScantheWorld&nbsp;is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Aristoteles - final\" (https://skfb.ly/o99UI) by edioudi is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"Insectoid Crab Monster\" (https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/insectoid-crab-monster-lurker-of-the-shores-20-animations-107223).<br><br>“Egyptian Cat Statue” (https://skfb.ly/6ACLr) by Ankledot is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Coffins of Pa-di-mut, Mut-iy-y, and Ankh-Khonsu” (https://skfb.ly/6QTHw) by Harvard Museum of the Ancient Near East is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Egyptian Head” (https://skfb.ly/6WLWq) by IU Indianapolis University Library is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Egyptian Head” (https://skfb.ly/MTXV) by MSU Broad Art Museum is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Egyptian necklace” (https://skfb.ly/oFnEU) by C.J. Goldman is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>“Egyptian Statue” (https://skfb.ly/oI8x6) by kckaiwei is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n<br>\n<br>“Giant sculpture of a scarab beetle (update '16)” (https://skfb.ly/K6ND) by Thomas Flynn is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n<br>\n<br>“Egyptian-style sphinx statue” (https://skfb.ly/oENxw) by Sofia Nasopoulou is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n<br>\n<br>“Egyptian Fountain, Paris” (https://skfb.ly/6ZLnF) by Oscar Falmer is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n<br>\n<br>“Kaemwaset Kneeling with an Emblem of Hathor” (https://skfb.ly/6QW7V) by iuegypt is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution‑NoDerivs (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/).\n<br>\n<br>“Statue of Ramesses III” (https://skfb.ly/Ws8w) by Abby Gancz is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>“Statue of Khafre, Egyptian Museum, Cairo” (https://skfb.ly/6R7uV) by danderson4 is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Egyptian Vase (Free)” (https://skfb.ly/6XPCr) by wolfgar74 is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br>\n<br>“Egyptian Lotus Vase” (https://skfb.ly/6U9V8) by Aurorastorm is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).<br><br>\"The Greylands: One-Handed Melee Weapons\" (https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/weapons/the-greylands-one-handed-melee-weapons-221680).<br><br>\"RunesPortalsAndDemons\" (https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/fantasy/runesportalsanddemons-85098).</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
